      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Apr 2025 17:04:45 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/docs/neurodiversity/walker2014/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;原文链接: Nick Walker（2014）：&lt;a href=&#34;https://neuroqueer.com/neurodiversity-terms-and-definitions/&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;Neurodiversity: Some Basic Terms &amp;amp; Definitions&lt;svg width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M14 5c-.552 0-1-.448-1-1s.448-1 1-1h6c.552 0 1 .448 1 1v6c0 .552-.448 1-1 1s-1-.448-1-1v-3.586l-7.293 7.293c-.391.39-1.024.39-1.414 0-.391-.391-.391-1.024 0-1.414l7.293-7.293h-3.586zm-9 2c-.552 0-1 .448-1 1v11c0 .552.448 1 1 1h11c.552 0 1-.448 1-1v-4.563c0-.552.448-1 1-1s1 .448 1 1v4.563c0 1.657-1.343 3-3 3h-11c-1.657 0-3-1.343-3-3v-11c0-1.657 1.343-3 3-3h4.563c.552 0 1 .448 1 1s-.448 1-1 1h-4.563z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;原标题：“Neurodiversity: Some Basic Terms &amp;amp; Definitions”&lt;br&gt;&#xA;作者：Nick Walker，加州整合大学（CIIS）心理学教授、孤独谱系障碍酷儿学者&lt;br&gt;&#xA;（本译文已由原作者授权。）&lt;br&gt;&#xA;翻译：Alexander，Rossa，&lt;a href=&#34;https://neuroxyz.cn&#34; rel=&#34;external&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;XyZ&lt;svg width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M14 5c-.552 0-1-.448-1-1s.448-1 1-1h6c.552 0 1 .448 1 1v6c0 .552-.448 1-1 1s-1-.448-1-1v-3.586l-7.293 7.293c-.391.39-1.024.39-1.414 0-.391-.391-.391-1.024 0-1.414l7.293-7.293h-3.586zm-9 2c-.552 0-1 .448-1 1v11c0 .552.448 1 1 1h11c.552 0 1-.448 1-1v-4.563c0-.552.448-1 1-1s1 .448 1 1v4.563c0 1.657-1.343 3-3 3h-11c-1.657 0-3-1.343-3-3v-11c0-1.657 1.343-3 3-3h4.563c.552 0 1 .448 1 1s-.448 1-1 1h-4.563z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
